## DOCUMENTATION AUTO-UPDATE RULES

**Every time you modify firmware or GUI code, you MUST also update these files.**
Do not ask — just do it automatically as part of the same edit session.

### README.md
- Keep the Table of Contents in sync with actual sections
- Update firmware version badge if version changed
- Update "What changed" table under "Firmware: main.cpp Changes"
- Update the serial protocol table if any JSON field changed
- Update the GUI feature table if any UI feature changed

### docs/SERIAL_PROTOCOL.md
Auto-regenerate the full protocol reference whenever:
- Any JSON field is added/removed/renamed in `main.cpp`
- Any `CMD:*` command is added/removed
- The baud rate changes

Template:
```markdown
# Nira Serial Protocol Reference
_Auto-generated from main.cpp — do not edit manually_
_Last updated: [DATE] | Firmware: vX.Y_

## Transport
...
## Data Frame Fields
| Field | Type | Unit | Description |
...
## Commands
| Command | Effect |
...
```

### docs/FIRMWARE_API.md
Auto-regenerate from Doxygen comments whenever main.cpp changes.
Include: all public functions, their parameters, return values, and which JSON fields they affect.

### docs/GUI_USER_GUIDE.md
Update whenever nira_gui.py UI changes:
- Installation steps
- All button/control descriptions
- Screenshot placeholder `![Screenshot](../assets/gui_screenshot.png)`
- CSV column reference
- Print report section reference

### CHANGELOG.md
**Always append a new entry** (never edit old entries) using Keep a Changelog format:
```markdown
## [X.Y.Z] — YYYY-MM-DD
### Added
- ...
### Changed
- ...
### Fixed
- ...
```

